            1,
            "",
            "The pod's door opens, showing a white-haired girl who's disconnecting all the data transfer cables from herself. Then, she stumbles out of the pod, having yet to regain her sense of balance."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 10,
        "ActionId": 10,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Babylonia's \"QRF\"... Vera, Lee, Ayla, Karenina... and Commandant..."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 11,
        "ActionId": 11,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Dulcinea separates their shared memories and enters them in order into this gigantic \"prediction\" machine for simulation."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 12,
        "ActionId": 12,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Dulcinea always finds herself momentarily lost between reality and virtuality every time a simulation like this is run, and it always takes her a considerable amount of time to re-acclimate after a simulation."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 13,
        "ActionId": 13,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "This time, she went through four rounds of simulation in a row."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 14,
        "ActionId": 14,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "\"Ma'am, it appears that you have been affected to a significant extent by the simulations. Would you like to re-acclimate before the next simulation?\""
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 15,
        "ActionId": 15,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Affected to a significant extent? By the simulations? Always a bystander throughout the simulations, Dulcinea can't even begin to imagine what's affected her..."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 16,
        "ActionId": 16,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "But whatever that might be, it seems almost insignificant compared to what Constellia is up against at the moment..."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 17,
        "ActionId": 17,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Dulcinea",
